  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported AnalyzeEx, Analyze, IsAnalyzing and both GetAnalysisStatus overloads with preserved signatures and complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added named analysis flags and immutable status snapshots with strict integer, diagnostic-count and CPU-time validation. Retained constructing-thread, binding and lifetime guards without retries, automatic saves or cache refresh. Thirty-five Root operations are implemented; see the analysis guide for request effects, query-success semantics and native qualification limits.",
